+        "runs in O(n*2^n), uses 11,424 exact arithmetic operations at shipping n=10, "
+        "and has measured wall-clock cost recorded by selftest; the compact row-character "
+        "route uses 192 sign operations but must first be recognized and indexed exactly."
+    ),
